WEBVTT

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:14.000
Every frosted arch preserves an abandoned moment the Maker tried to undo.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:17.350
Warning!

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:22.100
Any cold blue rewind surge sweeps unsteady travelers straight back to the entrance.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.220
Digital echoes can copy cold blue light,

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:46.940
yet only a true memory carries living warm shadow.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:02.760
...is still breathing just beyond the broken bridge.

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:07.250
The stepping slabs rewind too fast for heavy boots,

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:10.870
unless someone agile leaps straight across her own frozen shadows.

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:25.300
...that even a hesitant first line deserves to stay remembered.

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:42.850
...belongs forever on the true map of the Maker's journey.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.870
The pixel dust is already spilling!

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:50.250
It is heading straight for the arches and origami towers.
